    "Do not rerun s1-s2/metadata.py: it predates the Codex1 measured additions. Preserve/merge this file.",
    "v2-s12x-* live in ../s1-s2-extra and are unique names. Other art remains owned by Codex2.",
    "Repeated placements are separately named with use. Composite timeline curves already contain their nodes; no duplicate nodes are added.",
    "Scene furniture/3D staff and diner bodies are world art, not foreground sprite placements. Name-tag thumbnail and catalogue furniture are UI.",
    "Portrait identity slots inferred from the depicted hats; lead may bind the same slot to live crew data. Future timeline guest silhouettes use the same art with lower opacity; fill arcs/progress are runtime-clipped.",
    "Rects are visual estimates in native mockup coordinates; full alpha art crops are disclosed, not vector-perfect match or runtime acceptance."
  ]
